    "preamble": "Ahammed Naseef vs State Of Kerala on 7 June, 2024 Author: Bechu Kurian Thomas Bench: Bechu Kurian Thomas In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice Bechu Kurian Thomas Friday, the 7th day of June 2024 / 17th Jyaishta, 1946 Crl.M.Appl.No.1/2024 In Crl.Mc No. 4916 Of 2024 Cc 397/2022 Of Judicial Magistrate Of First Class, Perambra Petitioner(S)/Accused Nos. 3 To 9: 1. Ahammed Naseef, Aged 35 Years, S/O Soopy, Kaniyaram Kandam (H), Puthur P.O., Omassery, Kozhikode District, Pin - 673582 2. Marakombath Muhammed, Aged 61 Years, S/O Seethi, Marakombath (H), Edacheri P.O.,Kozhikode District, Pin - 673502 3. Shaheer C, Aged 35 Years, S/O Ammed Haji, Chalil (H), Kakannur, Edacheri, Vatakara, Kozhikode District, Pin - 673502 4. Shabeer M.M, Aged 33 Years, S/O Abdul Kadar, Safa (H), Peringathur, Thalassery, Kannur District, Pin - 670675 5. Usman Tharayintavida, Aged 62 Years, S/O Ammad, Thattante Parambath (H), Edacheri, Vatakara, Kozhikode District, Pin - 673502 6. Shaheera, Aged 34 Years, D/O Ammed Haji, Kuniyil (H), Prakkadav, Puliyayi, Chekkiad, Kozhikode District, Pin - 673509 7. KUNHALU UMMAR MOHAMMED, AGED 61 YEARS, S/O UMMAR MOHAMMED, BAITHUL BARKA (H), PERINGATHUR P.O, KANNUR DISTRICT, PIN - 670675 RESPONDENT(S)/STATE AND COMPLAINANT: 1. STATE OF KERALA, REPRESENTED BY PUBLIC PROSECUTOR,HIGH COURT OF KERALA, PIN - 682031 2. FOOD SAFETY OFFICER, PERAMBRA CIRCLE, OFFICE OF THE FOOD SAFETY OFFICER, MINI CIVIL STATION, PERAMBRA, PIN - 673525 Application praying that in the circumstances stated in the affidavit filed therewith the High Court be pleased to stay all further proceedings as against the Petitioners in C.C. 397/22 before the Judicial First Class Magistrate Court-I, Perambra, in the interest of Justice. This Application coming on for orders upon perusing the application and upon hearing the arguments of M/S. ADITHYA RAJEEV, S.PARVATHI & SAFA NAVAS, Advocates for the petitioners and PUBLIC PROSECUTOR for R1, the court passed the following: BECHU KURIAN THOMAS, J. =-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-= Crl.M.A.No.1 of 2024 in Ahammed Naseef vs State Of Kerala on 7 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/31656361/ 1 Crl.M.C.No.4916 of 2024 =-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-= Dated this the 7th day of June, 2024",
